      "title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"d9f973730c7db64a\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThe HARPS search for southern extra-solar planets. XLVI. 12 super-Earths around the solar type stars HD 39194, HD 93385, HD 96700, HD 154088, and HD 189567 - ADS\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"d9f973730c7db64a\">>>",
